WEBVTT

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:03.450
Okay.

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:05.240
What?

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.620
Your manga's getting serialized, Koyume-chan?

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.240
Yup! It's not going to be very long, though.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:10.030
Huh?

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:11.360
Congratulations!

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:12.450
Thanks!

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.320
I'm so excited for my first serialized series!

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.250
Koyume-chan... got a serialization...

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.440
That's amazing.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:25.480
Please do not forget the existence of 
a lowly background character named Kaos!

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:25.920
Ay!

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:26.500
Ay!

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:27.300
Ay!

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.890
You'll always be my main 
character, Kaos-chan!

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:51.320
Comic Girls

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:05.540
We were celebrating 
Koyume-chan's serialization

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:07.600
and the time completely got away from me.

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:11.020
Nyaos-sensei?

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:15.600
Nyaos-sensei, what's wrong?

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:20.320
Where are you?

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:25.240
Nyaos-sensei!

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:31.040
I could use a cat's help, too!

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:32.180
Fuura-senpai?!

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:36.710
Fuura-senpai, is the deadline for your manuscript looming?

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:38.500
Yes...

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:41.360
But I'm not very popular,

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:43.870
so I can't ask for assistants...

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:46.930
Ruki-chan used to help me out,

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:49.600
but she's gotten busy now, too.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:52.610
And now, Koyume-chan's 
manga is getting serialized, too...

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:55.080
Don't be like that, Fuura-senpai.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:57.610
I'm right here!

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:00.530
Kaos-chan... My friend!

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:02.430
I'm not very good, but I'll help...

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:05.370
No, I'm really, really, really, 
really not very good,

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:08.130
but I'm the least busy in this dorm.

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:09.880
I'm actually very confident about that.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:11.330
Kaos-chan?

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:14.930
Are you sure?

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:16.040
Of course!

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:16.800
Wait, huh?

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.730
Come to think of it, 
Fuura-senpai, your room...

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:24.050
I'm so moved that you're 
visiting my room, Kaos-chan!

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:26.330
Come in!

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:27.930
A-Amazing...

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:34.530
I didn't know there was a room 
like this in the attic.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.270
It's nothing much, but...

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:41.720
Huh?

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:44.150
Kaos-chan?!

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:48.720
Could you apply screentone to this?

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:51.250
S-Screentone?

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:52.850
I'm not very good with them.

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:55.120
I'm scared of the cutters, 
I'm slow, just bad at using them...

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:56.240
Really?

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:58.610
I-I'm used to doing inking, so I can do that!

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:00.780
I'll do my best doing inking!

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:03.220
A page that requires 
a lot of inking...

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:05.840
Then how about this page where they come 
out of the darkness, covered in bloo—

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:07.180
I'll do my best with the screentones!

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:09.330
Um... Um...

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.200
Oh, crap. I went out of the line.

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:14.720
I know.

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:16.410
Then how about backgrounds?

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:18.270
B-Backgrounds?

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:19.930
Don't worry.

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:22.340
They're really easy,

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:25.020
so if you could just apply 
the vanishing points...

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:27.650
Um... where do they go?

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:31.790
Right here...

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.030
Huh?

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.760
Right here.

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:39.460
Then you draw a line toward here.

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:40.760
Do you understand?

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:43.050
I'm sorry, one more time.

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:45.060
Oh, goodness.

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:51.490
Okay, next...

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:53.450
Kaos-chan, relax.

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:54.170
Okay.

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:56.670
Look. Everyone's cheering you on.

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:57.940
Everyone?

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:00.720
Our eyes met!

00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:02.690
Nebuta?!

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:05.220
Kokeshi dolls and Akabekos...

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:08.330
Fuura-senpai, are you from 
the Tohoku region?

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.260
Yes, Aomori.

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:12.650
I'm from Fukushima!

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:14.050
I see!

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:16.180
I just assumed that you were 
from the Kanto region.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:19.110
You don't have an accent, 
either, so I couldn't tell!

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:22.140
I never had the chance 
to talk to people very often,

00:05:22.140 --> 00:05:24.320
so the accent might've never stuck.

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:25.560
I get it.

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:28.770
People who had more friends 
seemed to have heavier accents.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.160
By the way, Fuura-senpai,

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:38.420
you're really good at drawing.

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:39.230
Huh?

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:41.440
That makes me really happy.

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:45.720
But I used to be really bad.

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:46.550
Huh?

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:48.650
Would you like to see the 
first one I submitted?

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:53.200
So scar...y?

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.800
Or so I thought...

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:57.810
Like there's a lot of emphasis, 
but it's not very scary.

00:05:57.810 --> 00:06:00.620
My passion was a little out of sorts.

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:02.160
How embarrassing.

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:06.260
That's when the girl I was 
rooming with told me

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:08.960
that if I wanted to draw 
scary and alien things,

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:13.360
I need to be able to draw 
a normal world properly first.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:15.280
I see.

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:20.750
That's when I studied sketching 
and perspective really hard...

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:22.100
And because of that...

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:24.440
I've improved this much!

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:24.450
A surprise attack!

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:26.570
Huh?

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:29.170
Whatever happened to the 
person you were rooming with?

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:31.680
Actually...

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:32.290
Huh?!

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:34.680
No...

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:43.040
I'm going on a trip!

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:42.220
I think...

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:44.720
She went on a research trip.

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:46.090
You startled me!

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:47.940
Isn't that mean?

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:51.010
I thought we were best friends,

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:54.180
but she didn't even tell me where she was 
going or leave me her contact information.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.300
I don't even know if she'll be back.

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:58.190
Fuura-senpai...

00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:01.070
My feelings were just too strong,

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:03.700
and before I realized it, 
I was all alone again.

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:05.320
I totally understand!

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:09.900
Fuura-senpai, you're my friend!

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.290
Forever!

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:14.350
Kaos-chan...

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:16.740
If you say something that kind...

00:07:20.510 --> 00:07:23.710
I'm never going to let you leave!

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:29.220
I wonder if that came 
as a shock for Kaos-chan...

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:33.630
Please do not forget the existence of 
a lowly background character named Kaos!

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:36.560
I wonder what kind of advice 
I should give her...

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:40.720
That came from Fuura-senpai's room...

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:43.510
Fuura-senpai, um...

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:46.640
Kaos-chan?!

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:49.840
Kaos-chan, are you okay?!

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:52.960
Oh, Ruki-san in glasses...

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:54.980
So... lovely.

00:07:54.980 --> 00:07:56.540
Fuura-senpai!

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:58.850
Please stop making Kaos-chan cry!

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:01.840
She was just being my assistant.

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:03.120
Look.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.170
Kaos-chan drew this for me.

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:06.340
Isn't it well done?

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:10.970
Please don't lie like that!

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:13.410
Kaos-chan can't draw...

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:15.410
that properly!

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:18.040
Ruki-chan.

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:19.700
Please have a little faith in her.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:22.990
No way..

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:24.150
Oh, my gosh, I'm sorry!

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:25.950
Kaos-chan, you're amazing! 
Absolutely amazing!

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:26.660
No...

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:29.190
I was only able to draw that 
because of Fuura-senpai!

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.700
Fuura-senpai,

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:34.380
you're really good at teaching others.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:37.160
You taught me a lot, as well.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:38.720
Oh, it's nothing...

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:42.340
You'll try to scare 
us and get really close...

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:46.180
But you also help us calm our nerves...

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:47.010
Huh?

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:50.140
Then that was on purpose?

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:54.160
And Ruki-san even realized that...

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:57.010
Oh?

00:08:57.010 --> 00:08:59.180
You don't even realize it, do you?!

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:00.820
Fuura-senpai!

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:03.430
I really learned a lot!

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.030
It was scary...

00:09:05.030 --> 00:09:08.060
but I feel like something's 
opened up for me a bit more.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:09.200
Really?

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:10.880
For example...

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:13.570
I feel the same satisfaction I would 
if I just finished shoveling snow!

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:14.820
I can't even picture that...

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:15.940
I understand!

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:17.970
Shoveling snow is so hard!

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:19.800
It's cold, but you end up so sweaty!

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:21.780
Not to mention, it piles 
up again so quickly.

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:23.090
I know!

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:25.540
Would you two stop getting 
so excited in your own world?!

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:33.810
<i>Ruki-san in glasses...</i>

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:37.840
<i>Since the other day, I keep 
thinking about how beautiful she is.</i>

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:41.240
<i>I could stare at her profile forever...</i>

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:44.400
<i>She always makes the cutest expressions,</i>

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:46.580
<i>but when she's working in her glasses,</i>

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:48.220
<i>she looks so elegant...</i>

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:50.030
<i>so divine...</i>

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:51.820
Kaos-chan?

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:55.520
I'm so sorry! I'll pay an admission fee!

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:56.580
What are you talking about?

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:58.240
Oh,

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:02.380
I was just thinking how much more mature 
and lovely you look with glasses on.

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:03.960
Y-You think so?

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:04.770
Yes.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:07.950
I was thinking about this the other day when 
Fuura-senpai was instructing me...

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:11.000
That mature ladies are so lovely.

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.680
The matron is so accepting...

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:16.010
You, too, Ruki-san...

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:17.970
<i>Your storyboard!</i>

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:19.970
Oh, I guess Amisawa-san's a little different.

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:19.960
<i>What?!</i>

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:21.240
<i>Are you mocking me?!</i>

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:23.880
No! I really like you, Amisawa-san,

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.220
but you lack the charm 
of an older woman—

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:27.870
You're the last one I want 
to hear that from, Kaos-sensei!

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:29.060
Hurry up with the storyboard!

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:30.480
I'm so sorry!

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:31.290
What's wrong?!

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:34.830
I-I was just saying how lovely 
mature women are.

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:37.770
Then, why don't you get some glasses, too?

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:38.860
Me?

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:42.450
You know, you were saying there've been 
gaps lately when you do inking,

00:10:42.810 --> 00:10:45.920
so your eyesight might've 
gotten a little worse.

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:47.530
Maybe if you put some glasses on,

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:49.730
you'd suddenly look really grown-up.

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:52.080
Me?

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:58.130
<i>Join the ranks of the holy 
and empyreal glasses character?!</i>

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:01.070
Glasses are too heavy 
a burden for me to bear!

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:03.060
Oh, come on. You're not that flimsy.

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:05.610
No, that's not it!

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:09.880
Oh, but...

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:13.210
Where?

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:16.020
Where did you go?

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:21.910
What's wrong, Koyume?

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:23.990
Kaos-chan...

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:26.250
disappeared!

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:27.810
Why are you looking in there?!

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:29.830
It's fine.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:30.760
She left a note.

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:36.840
"I have taken the first step 
to becoming a holier person."

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:37.710
Koyume-chan, I have taken the first step 
to becoming a holier person. I'm totally fine 
by myself... So please don't worry... Kaos

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:39.740
"I'm totally fine by myself..."

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:41.830
"So please don't worry..."

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:46.730
Now I feel like something's 
definitely going to happen!

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:49.170
Me, too...

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:55.440
<i>I-I ended up coming alone...</i>

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:57.940
<i>But I learned how to ride the train,</i>

00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:59.890
<i>and I'm not a kid anymore!</i>

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:01.280
<i>I'll be okay...</i>

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:05.360
Are you running some errands? 
What a good little girl.

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:06.990
Would you like a rice cracker?

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:13.000
Episode 7
"Is This Heaven?!"

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:13.000
We will soon be
arriving in Akihabara... 
Akihabara

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:13.000
Aba...
Grandchild?!

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:13.000
It's getting chilly these days,
so take care.

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:13.000
My grandchild happens to be
about your age. At the school play...

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:13.000
My, how adorable.

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:13.000
Take these mandarins with you.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.000
Over 10 million copies sold!!

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.000
Starting Broadcast in mid-December

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.000
Maid Café

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:21.090
Is this heaven?!

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:28.510
<i>I ended up taking a little detour 
before buying my glasses,</i>

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:31.930
<i>but I've always dreamed of 
stopping by this mecca for otaku</i>

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:34.380
<i>ever since I moved to Tokyo...</i>

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:38.400
I hope
you'll listen!

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:38.400
New Arrivals
Corner

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:38.400
<i>Even the displays are 
filled with so much love.</i>

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.830
<i>They have all the books 
and merchandise I wanted!</i>

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:44.820
<i>I'm so blessed to be able 
to buy things on their release day!</i>

00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:52.640
<i>The figure I wasn't sure 
if I should buy or not!</i>

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:57.080
<i>I can actually feel her aura, 
now that I see it in person!</i>

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:59.050
<i>She's alive!</i>

00:12:59.050 --> 00:13:03.040
<i>I'm so thankful to have been 
born in the same era as her...</i>

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:06.440
Mom... Dad...

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:08.010
She must be lost!

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:12.480
<i>I ended up buying it...</i>

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:14.940
That last episode was godly!

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:16.580
I was so worked up!

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:19.630
That must be so nice...

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:22.560
I want to nerd out about anime 
with someone, too...

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:26.720
I-I'm not emotionally prepared yet!

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:27.930
What are you talking about?

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:30.490
A police officer?

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:31.810
How old are you?

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:32.200
Huh?

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:33.760
Where are your parents?

00:13:33.760 --> 00:13:36.580
I've been watching you for 
a while, but you seem...

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:37.900
I'm getting the Creeper Award...

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:40.130
for creepily grinning to myself 
and now I'm going to get arrested?!

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.450
Award?

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:43.510
I'm so sorry! I'll go home now!

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:44.880
Wait, is that where you live?!

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.490
Where did she run off to?

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:55.130
<i>It's too scary going 
outside alone, after all...</i>

00:13:55.130 --> 00:13:56.690
<i>I want to go home.</i>

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:20.240
I miss everyone.

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:21.710
Kaos-chan!

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:32.640
Everyone...

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:34.060
Thank goodness!

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:35.360
Are you okay?

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:37.360
She was <i>actually</i> in a box...

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:40.420
We were so worried, jeez!

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:43.830
I'm so sorry!

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:49.340
But how did you know I was here?

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:51.220
Oh, actually...

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:54.580
Ruki-chan found some tweets 
that we thought were yours.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.790
Box nao

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.790
<u>5 min ago</u>

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.790
I want to go home...

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.790
<u>10 min ago</u>

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.790
I bought the Rukanyan figure!! So majestic!! I can't!! Squee!!

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.790
<u>30 min ago</u>

00:14:57.840 --> 00:15:01.030
You're so excitable 
on the Internet, Kaos-chan.

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:03.180
Please don't! Please don't!

00:15:03.180 --> 00:15:05.120
Oh, is this the figure 
you were talking about?

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:07.490
Can I look?

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:08.640
Sure...

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:12.960
She's so cute!

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:15.230
Her name's Rukanyan.

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:16.940
Rukanyan's adorable!

00:15:18.240 --> 00:15:21.140
Her outfit right here is so detailed!

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:22.920
You're right! It's so pretty!

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.730
P-Please look at 
her from this angle, too.

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.160
<i>It feels so nice to have someone 
agree with you!</i>

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:31.110
Kaos-chan's totally fired up.

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:33.400
Hey, this anime...

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:35.030
New
Anime

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:35.030
Limited Edition Flier

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:35.350
Isn't it cool?

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:36.330
You know it?

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:39.920
I'm the type that thoroughly 
reads up on every anime.

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:41.120
You are?

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:42.260
Yes!

00:15:42.260 --> 00:15:44.780
This series was so good!

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:47.120
Especially the ending of episode six.

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:52.830
They're communicating with their eyes...

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:56.370
Oh, so you came to have some glasses made.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:57.240
Yes.

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:59.280
Since I came here all alone,

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:02.610
I thought I'd stop by the place I'd 
always dreamed of going to first.

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:05.690
So that thing about 
becoming a holier person...

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:07.970
I'm taking the first step to 
becoming a character with glasses.

00:16:07.970 --> 00:16:09.200
Oh, but I mean,

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:12.610
that's too much for 
me to handle, isn't it?

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:14.690
Exactly how much do you 
admire characters with glasses?

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:16.450
Glasses Market

00:16:18.380 --> 00:16:19.770
Welcome.

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:21.620
What brings you here today?

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:23.210
Wh-What brings me here today?!

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:23.790
Yes.

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:26.660
Y-You've got it all wrong!

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:30.420
It's not like I was trying to act all cool 
and amazing by getting glasses—

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:32.280
No, Kaos-chan.

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:35.200
She's asking if they're for all day wear 
or like when you're using the computer...

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:36.040
Huh?

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:40.990
How about this one?

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:42.850
Righ... Left?

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:46.160
Looks like your right 
eye is 0.7 and your left is 0.6.

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:48.040
S-So close...

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:50.880
They might continue to get worse,

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:52.860
so I do recommend having 
some glasses made right now.

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:55.490
Your eyes tend to 
worsen during puberty.

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.190
Puberty?

00:16:57.190 --> 00:16:59.600
Have I started puberty?

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:01.110
Have I grown?!

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:03.210
Nothing?

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:05.490
I'm supposed to pick from these?

00:17:05.490 --> 00:17:08.280
I think pink would look 
best on you, Kaos-chan.

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:09.120
Here.

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:14.790
Don't I look a bit conceited?

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:17.010
Black ones might look tamer.

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:19.760
I-I look shady...

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:22.320
Metal frames make 
you look more mature.

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:23.520
Or not...

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:26.350
Oval-shaped glasses 
look good on anyone...

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:27.440
Or not...

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.630
Why don't you start from one 
side and try them all one by one?

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:32.320
It's no use.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:35.020
I think all the glasses hate me.

00:17:35.020 --> 00:17:36.470
That's not true!

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:38.000
It must be because of your expression!

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:40.240
Come on, sharpen up!

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:45.320
I'm so sorry, o God of Glasses! 
Please forgive me!

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:47.920
<i>She even had a prop ready.</i>

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:51.250
I think I want some glasses, too...

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:54.910
Whoops...

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:56.560
They don't look good on me, after all.

00:17:56.560 --> 00:18:00.000
You should wear glasses that are
simpler and more casual, Koyume-chan.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.920
And if you wore your loungewear 
and pigtails, you'd look perfect!

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:06.440
Don't worry about mine. 
Pick some out for yourself.

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:09.910
Tsubasa-san...

00:18:09.910 --> 00:18:11.890
You're already cool enough as it is.

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:13.440
If you put on glasses...

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:16.240
Bang.

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:18.370
So cool!

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:20.320
You're actually okay with that, Koyume-chan?

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:22.530
Glasses Market

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:24.720
This is the place.

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:26.040
A glasses shop?

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:28.690
Did you have bad eyesight, Miharu-senpai?

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.730
Nope. Both of my eyes are 1.5.

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:32.780
Then why are you...

00:18:32.780 --> 00:18:34.530
I thought that if I wore glasses,

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:36.250
I might look more like a teacher.

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:39.380
Don't wear glasses as if you're cosplaying!

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:41.550
Glasses exist to correct your vision!

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:43.070
If you buy glasses that 
don't have a prescription,

00:18:43.070 --> 00:18:44.580
I'm never speaking to you again!

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:45.640
That voice...

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:47.370
Fine.

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:50.770
Jeez... I wanted to make my debut 
as a bespectacled teacher.

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:58.640
Just because they look amazing on you,

00:18:58.640 --> 00:19:01.140
I won't... I won't...

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:02.420
Let's allow it!

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:03.120
Moeta-san.

00:19:04.180 --> 00:19:05.730
Kaos-sensei.

00:19:05.730 --> 00:19:07.410
Did you come to have 
some glasses made?

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:08.750
Y-Yes!

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:10.570
But I haven't been able 
to make up my mind...

00:19:10.570 --> 00:19:13.130
I love people with glasses.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:17.020
I want people who are smart, mature,

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:20.500
or mysterious to wear glasses...

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:23.400
Anyway, they're on a completely 
different level than me.

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:25.170
Kaos-sensei...

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:28.160
I mean, the reason I'm getting 
them is pretty vague,

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:32.160
and I feel really guilty 
even wearing them.

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:34.210
This is troubling you that much?

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:38.740
I totally understand.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:39.510
Huh?

00:19:39.510 --> 00:19:41.340
I experienced the same 
kind of conflict and

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:44.240
spent a lot of my time squinting my eyes 
until I was a third-year in high school.

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:46.070
Really?

00:19:46.070 --> 00:19:47.860
Then why did you get glasses?

00:19:47.860 --> 00:19:50.000
There were many reasons...

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:55.800
But I wanted to watch the anime that 
I loved in the highest definition possible.

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:57.120
Ah, I'm buying them.

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:02.890
The world looks so crisp!

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:05.560
I can't believe everything looks so clear!

00:20:05.560 --> 00:20:08.070
Ruki-san in HD!

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:09.960
They look good on you.

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:12.810
All of you are sparkling more than ever!

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:14.330
You look so cute!

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:15.400
Good for you.

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:19.490
Even my figures look more detailed!

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:24.320
You sure have a lot of figures that 
look like Ruki-chan, Kaos-chan.

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:25.570
True.

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:30.780
I'm just so happy when I watch mature, 
older sister-type characters like Ruki-san.

00:20:30.780 --> 00:20:34.400
Oh, but I haven't tried to look 
at your panties, Ruki-san,

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:35.540
so please don't worry!

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:37.680
<i>So you've looked at the 
ones on your figures...</i>

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:41.860
By the way, what made you decide 
to go off on your own today?

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:43.520
Huh? Um...

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:48.360
I... get really awkwardly 
worked up when I nerd out...

00:20:48.360 --> 00:20:52.630
So I didn't want you to think any less of me 
if we went somewhere like that together.

00:20:52.630 --> 00:20:55.010
That wouldn't bug us at all!

00:20:55.010 --> 00:20:55.850
Also...

00:20:55.850 --> 00:21:00.450
I don't have a serialized manga 
like you do now, Koyume-chan...

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:03.520
So to become a lovely mature woman like 
Fuura-senpai or the bespectacled Ruki-san,

00:21:03.520 --> 00:21:09.330
I figured I couldn't just stay the 
way I am right now.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:14.430
But I ended up troubling 
all of you after all,

00:21:14.430 --> 00:21:16.440
so I'm really sorry!

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:21.190
Looks like puberty's definitely hit.

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:23.220
Huh? Really?

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:24.420
Have I grown?

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:26.890
Why don't you try drawing 
a manuscript now?

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:29.600
O-Okay!

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:38.860
There.

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:43.400
I think my backgrounds have definitely 
gotten better, thanks to Fuura-senpai.

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:44.900
All that's left is...

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:48.740
I can see the lines so clearly!

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:51.940
I'm still so...

00:21:51.940 --> 00:21:54.690
really, really awful!

00:21:54.690 --> 00:21:55.510
Kaos-chan?!

00:21:55.510 --> 00:21:57.090
I'm sealing away my glasses!

00:23:31.490 --> 00:23:33.400
The god has descended! 
The god has descended!

00:23:33.400 --> 00:23:34.800
Thank you so much!

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:36.460
What am I going to do?!

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:39.630
Next time, "Woof Meow 
Meow Woof Festival."

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:39.980
Next Time

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:39.980
Woof Meow Meow Woof Festival
